codex
Validation ordering is consistent with the current code: account type, NGO shape, and GitHub-link checks all precede acknowledgment text, so the existing `/platform_admin/`, `/github/`, and `/acknowledgment/i` assertions can retain their reasons. The main open questions now are whether the proposed greens prove the ratified wording and whether the migration can actually roll across existing environments.
