loop\items\AI4DEV-57\gate2-kimi-sql.incomplete-run.txt:118: Another subtlety: in `complete_signup`, error handling — the inner begin/exception catches unique_violation on the accounts insert. But a FK violation (auth user doesn't exist) raises 23503 → propagates, rollback. Fine.
