loop\items\AI4DEV-48\pr-body.md:1: The acceptance-test harness decided whether a capability was the real article or a stand-in by reading a word the caller passed in. The only validation was that the word was non-empty. So changing four wrappers in `tests/at/harness/index.ts` from stand-in to real emptied the list the integration-tier gate checks, and that gate — the one whose green is supposed to mean "earned against a real database and real product code" — passed with nothing behind it. No database touched, no product in existence, and nothing announcing it.
